                    schema:abstract "The Tunnel Load Simulator is an open-source Streamlit application developed within the SmartTunnel project to generate synthetic electrical load profiles for road tunnels. It combines simplified representations of lighting, ventilation, auxiliary loads, traffic patterns, seasonal effects and stochastic events such as pollution episodes or accidents." ;
